_SC_PAGESIZE           in range
_SC_NPROCESSORS_CONF   in range
_SC_NPROCESSORS_ONLN   in range
_SC_OPEN_MAX           in range
_SC_CLK_TCK            in range
_SC_ARG_MAX            in range
_SC_LINE_MAX           in range
_SC_HOST_NAME_MAX      in range
page is 2^n            yes
unknown name           refused with EINVAL
done
